SUMMARY:MTNS 2028 (est.) · Conference
DESCRIPTION:International Symposium on Mathematical Theory of Networks and 
 Systems\nStatus: estimated\, checked 2026-10-31. Check the organizer's ca
 ll before relying on it.\nOfficial source: https://uwaterloo.ca/internati
 onal-symposium-mathematical-theory-networks-systems/\nVenue Radar: https:
 //gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#mtns-2028\nNotes: As of 2026-10-31 the M
 TNS 2026 site and IFAC listing announce no MTNS 2028 host\, dates or call
 \; hosts rotate. MTNS is held every two years. Meeting dates (Mon-Fri) an
 d the Monday full-paper (Feb 7) and extended-abstract (Feb 14) deadlines 
 are two-year same-weekday proxies from MTNS 2026 (Aug 17-21\; Feb 9/16). 
 The same shift maps MTNS 2024 (Cambridge\, Aug 19-23\; papers and abstrac
 ts Feb 12 after an extension) onto 2026. Publication format is assumed fr
 om 2026. Website and source links refer to past editions. Size is an edit
 orial estimate.
